      "Language": "dut",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A 41-year-old man visited his general practitioner because of upper abdominal pain. Physical examination revealed splenomegaly. Laboratory testing showed pancytopenia with a striking monocytopenia with hairy cells. Immunological and molecular analysis confirmed the diagnosis hairy cell leukemia."},
